1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,682
In this lesson, you'll turn your best
reviews into a live widget on your website,

2
00:00:05,682 --> 00:00:10,161
so visitors see real proof from real
customers, updated automatically.

3
00:00:10,161 --> 00:00:13,359
No coding needed, and it
takes about five minutes.

4
00:00:14,212 --> 00:00:15,484
Social proof sells.

5
00:00:15,484 --> 00:00:20,439
A visitor who sees dozens of five-star
reviews is far more likely to book.

6
00:00:20,439 --> 00:00:24,523
Widgets show your Google and
Facebook reviews on any website,

7
00:00:24,523 --> 00:00:26,531
including your Kyntlo funnels.

8
00:00:26,531 --> 00:00:30,013
And unlike screenshots of
reviews, a widget is live,

9
00:00:30,013 --> 00:00:32,156
so visitors can trust it's real.

10
00:00:33,007 --> 00:00:35,127
Click New Widget to open the builder.

11
00:00:35,127 --> 00:00:39,827
Your settings are on the left, and a live
preview of your website is on the right,

12
00:00:39,827 --> 00:00:42,807
so you can see every change
before anyone else does.

13
00:00:43,657 --> 00:00:47,493
Give it a name you'll recognise,
like the page it's going on.

14
00:00:47,493 --> 00:00:52,083
You can create as many widgets as you
need, one for each page or website.

15
00:00:52,934 --> 00:00:54,289
Now choose a layout.

16
00:00:54,289 --> 00:00:57,677
A carousel slides through
reviews and saves space.

17
00:00:57,677 --> 00:01:00,252
A list suits a dedicated reviews page.

18
00:01:00,252 --> 00:01:04,114
A badge is a small rating seal
for your header or footer.

19
00:01:04,114 --> 00:01:06,892
And a grid shows lots of reviews at once.

20
00:01:06,892 --> 00:01:10,009
Pick the one that fits
the space on your page.

21
00:01:10,859 --> 00:01:15,199
Choose your sources, Google and
Facebook, and which ratings to show.

22
00:01:15,199 --> 00:01:20,306
Four stars and up is a good balance: it
looks great, and it still feels genuine.

23
00:01:20,306 --> 00:01:24,582
A wall of only five-star reviews
can actually look less believable.

24
00:01:25,430 --> 00:01:28,232
Match your website with
a light or dark theme,

25
00:01:28,232 --> 00:01:33,166
and choose what each review shows: the
rating summary, reviewer photos and dates.

26
00:01:33,166 --> 00:01:36,272
Every change shows up in
the preview straight away.

27
00:01:37,121 --> 00:01:37,906
Happy with it?

28
00:01:37,906 --> 00:01:38,914
Click Save widget.

29
00:01:38,914 --> 00:01:41,716
You can come back and
change it whenever you like.

30
00:01:42,566 --> 00:01:43,742
Now click Get code.

31
00:01:43,742 --> 00:01:46,528
This short snippet is
all your website needs.

32
00:01:46,528 --> 00:01:48,571
You don't need to be a developer.

33
00:01:48,571 --> 00:01:49,561
Click Copy code.

34
00:01:50,410 --> 00:01:54,896
Paste it into your website
wherever the reviews should appear.

35
00:01:54,896 --> 00:02:00,830
In a Kyntlo funnel or website, add a Custom
JS or HTML element and paste it there.

36
00:02:00,830 --> 00:02:05,461
On WordPress, Wix or Squarespace,
use their HTML or embed block.

37
00:02:06,310 --> 00:02:07,626
You only do this once.

38
00:02:07,626 --> 00:02:12,410
Every new review that matches your settings
appears in the widget automatically.

39
00:02:12,410 --> 00:02:17,433
And if you change the layout later, just
save it here, and your website updates too.

40
00:02:18,283 --> 00:02:19,311
Here's a pro tip.

41
00:02:19,311 --> 00:02:23,179
Place your review widget right
next to your main call to action,

42
00:02:23,179 --> 00:02:24,751
like your Book now button.

43
00:02:24,751 --> 00:02:27,410
Visitors hesitate at
the moment they decide,

44
00:02:27,410 --> 00:02:31,158
and that's exactly when proof
from other customers helps most.

45
00:02:31,158 --> 00:02:35,873
Add a small badge to your header too,
so your rating is visible on every page.

46
00:02:36,731 --> 00:02:39,237
That's the end of the Reputation module.

47
00:02:39,237 --> 00:02:39,863
Great job!

48
00:02:39,863 --> 00:02:44,813
Next, in module twelve, we'll set up
payments, starting with connecting Stripe,

49
00:02:44,813 --> 00:02:47,632
so you can take payments
right inside Kyntlo.

50
00:02:47,632 --> 00:02:48,509
See you there.
